  "dialogues": [
    {
      "en": "OAK: Hey! Wait!\\nDon't go out!$",
      "zh": "大木：喂！等一下！\\n别出去！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK: It's unsafe!\\nWild POKéMON live in tall grass!\\pYou need your own POKéMON for\\nyour protection.\\pI know!\\nHere, come with me!$",
      "zh": "大木：外面很危险！\\n草丛里住着野生宝可梦！\\p你需要有自己的宝可梦\\n来保护自己。\\p我知道了！\\n跟我来吧！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK: Be patient, {RIVAL}.\\nYou can have one, too!$",
      "zh": "大木：别着急，{RIVAL}。\\n你也可以选一只！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK: {RIVAL}?\\nLet me think…\\pOh, that's right, I told you to\\ncome! Just wait!\\pHere, {PLAYER}.\\pThere are three POKéMON here.\\pHaha!\\pThe POKéMON are held inside\\nthese POKé BALLS.\\pWhen I was young, I was a serious\\nPOKéMON TRAINER.\\pBut now, in my old age, I have\\nonly these three left.\\pYou can have one.\\nGo on, choose!$",
      "zh": "大木：{RIVAL}？\\n让我想想……\\p哦，对了，是我让你\\n来的！稍等一下！\\p给你，{PLAYER}。\\p这里有三只宝可梦。\\p哈哈！\\p宝可梦都装在\\n这些精灵球里。\\p我年轻的时候也是个\\n很厉害的训练家。\\p但现在年纪大了，\\n身边只剩下这三只。\\p你可以选一只。\\n来吧，挑一只吧！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK: Ah, {PLAYER}!\\nYou're back, are you?\\pHow much have you filled in your\\nPOKéDEX?\\pMay I see it?\\pLet's see…$",
      "zh": "大木：啊，{PLAYER}！\\n你回来啦？\\p你的宝可梦图鉴\\n填了多少了？\\p能让我看看吗？\\p我看看……$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: Wait! Where are you\\ngoing?$",
      "zh": "空木：等等！你要\\n去哪里？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: This?$",
      "zh": "空木：这个？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: Think it over carefully.\\pYour partner is important.$",
      "zh": "空木：好好考虑吧。\\p你的伙伴很重要。$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: I think that's a great\\nPOKéMON too!$",
      "zh": "空木：我觉得那只\\n宝可梦也很棒！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: You'll take {STR_VAR_1},\\nthe {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON?$",
      "zh": "空木：你要选{STR_VAR_1}，\\n那只{STR_VAR_2}宝可梦吗？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: Do you want {STR_VAR_1},\\nthe {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON?$",
      "zh": "空木：你想要{STR_VAR_1}，\\n那只{STR_VAR_2}宝可梦吗？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: So, you like {STR_VAR_1},\\nthe {STR_VAR_2} POKéMON?$",
      "zh": "空木：这么说，你喜欢{STR_VAR_1}，\\n那只{STR_VAR_2}宝可梦？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: Don't give up!\\nI'll call if I learn anything\\labout that EGG!$",
      "zh": "空木：别放弃！\\n那枚蛋要是有什么\\l消息，我会打电话给你的！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: Hey, has that EGG changed\\nany?$",
      "zh": "空木：那枚蛋\\n有什么变化吗？$"
    },
    {
      "en": "ELM: {PLAYER}! There you are!\\pI needed to ask you a favor.\\pI'm conducting new POKéMON\\nresearch right now. I was\\lwondering if you could help\\lme with it, {PLAYER}.\\pYou see…\\pI'm writing a paper that I\\nwant to present at a conference.\\pBut there are some things I\\ndon't quite understand yet.\\pSo!\\pI'd like you to raise a\\nPOKéMON that I recently caught.$",
      "zh": "空木：{PLAYER}！你来啦！\\p我有件事想拜托你。\\p我正在做新的宝可梦\\n研究，\\l想请你帮帮忙，\\l{PLAYER}。\\p你看……\\p我正在写一篇论文，\\n想在学会上发表。\\p但还有些地方\\n我怎么也想不明白。\\p所以！\\p我想请你培育一只\\n我最近刚捉到的宝可梦。$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK POKéMON RESEARCH LAB$",
      "zh": "大木宝可梦研究所$"
    },
    {
      "en": "OAK POKéMON\\nRESEARCH LAB$",
      "zh": "大木宝可梦\\n研究所$"
    },
    {
      "en": "POKéMON LEAGUE$",
      "zh": "宝可梦联盟$"
    },
    {
      "en": "POKéMON JOURNAL$",
      "zh": "宝可梦周刊$"
    },
    {
      "en": "We hope to see you again!$",
      "zh": "欢迎下次再来！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "Please step this way.$",
      "zh": "这边请。$"
    },
    {
      "en": "Here you go!$",
      "zh": "给你！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "Please do visit again.$",
      "zh": "欢迎再来。$"
    },
    {
      "en": "Thank you for playing!$",
      "zh": "感谢您的游玩！$"
    },
    {
      "en": "You don't have enough money.$",
      "zh": "你的钱不够。$"
    },
    {
